{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"huangli-e-o151","title":"张嶷诛复反冬逢","accounts":[{"id":"huangli-a-bb8532f7447a0f48d720","label":"正文","text":"张嶷诛复反冬逢","evidence":["huangli-q-8e08b93cceb53175213b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houzhu-p0028","role":"诛逢","evidence":["huangli-q-8e08b93cceb53175213b"]},{"person":"huangli-p0002","role":"苏祁邑君，已降复反，被诛","evidence":["huangli-q-8e08b93cceb53175213b"]},{"person":"huangli-p0031","role":"冬逢弟，已降复反","evidence":["huangli-q-8e08b93cceb53175213b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huangli-q-8e08b93cceb53175213b"]},"ordering_evidence":"huangli-q-8e08b93cceb53175213b","source_order":[43,220,0],"order":7684}],"persons":[{"id":"huangli-p0002","name":"冬逢","evidence":["huangli-q-8e08b93cceb53175213b","huangli-q-e7075147cee9648ebad5","huangli-q2-67ddc4ef5ebb47f8eef9"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"huangli-m2-role-080f154c9f6c5685eeb4","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["huangli-q-e7075147cee9648ebad5","huangli-q2-67ddc4ef5ebb47f8eef9"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huangli-q-8e08b93cceb53175213b","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-50c976d911cb3286a22c","layer":"original","quote":"苏祁邑君冬逢、逢弟隗渠等〖6〗，已降复反。嶷诛逢","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-e7075147cee9648ebad5","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-19b062ec4db099e20cc4","layer":"original","quote":"其率狼路，欲为姑婿冬逢报怨，遣叔父离，将逢众相度形势","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q2-67ddc4ef5ebb47f8eef9","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-19b062ec4db099e20cc4","layer":"original","quote":"汉嘉郡界旄牛夷，种类四千余户。其率狼路，欲为姑婿冬逢报怨，遣叔父离，将逢众相度形势〖17〗。嶷逆遣亲近赍牛酒劳赐〖18〗，又令离（姊）逆逢妻宣畅意旨〖19〗。离既受赐，并见其姊；姊弟欢悦，悉率所领将诣嶷。嶷厚加赏待，遣还；旄牛由是辄不为患。郡有旧道，经旄牛中至成都，既平且近；自旄牛绝道，已百余年；更由安上，既险且远。嶷遣左右赍货币赐路，重令路姑喻意。路乃率兄弟妻子悉诣嶷。嶷与盟誓，开通旧道；千里肃清，复古亭驿。奏封路为旄牛0 毗王，遣使将路朝贡。","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":225,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
